# Does it answer touches? Awake, alone, daytime. Six isolated touches 25 s apart (every one
# should get an answer: a call, a lean, a happy face), then a burst of rapid touches (it
# should get annoyed and grumble), a quiet minute, and two more isolated touches.
duration 9:00
clock 14:00
seed 8
room_light on
at 0:50 touch_head 300   # after the clock (synced at 0:40): before it the robot keeps the quiet night rules
at 0:55 touch_head 300
at 1:20 touch_head 300
at 1:45 touch_head 300
at 2:10 touch_head 300
at 2:35 touch_head 300
every 0:02 from 3:10 until 3:30 touch_head 300
at 5:30 touch_head 300
at 5:55 touch_head 300
